color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> responsible_person(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market_scope       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- EU | GB | NI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (gtin, market_scope, effective_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 上线前阻断：任何在售 GTIN 必须有当前生效的责任人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> view</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> gtin_missing_responsible_person</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market_scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_listing p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">left join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_responsible_person r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  on</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market_scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market_scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">between</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'infinity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> is</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>market_scope</code> 放进主键，是因为同一商品在欧盟与 GB 可能需要不同的责任人（英国不再承认欧盟授权代表）。用视图而非应用层校验来做上线拦截，可以让合规检查同时被商品发布、批量导入、API 写入三条路径复用，避免漏检。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>境外制造商必须指定欧盟境内责任人，未指定时由进口商、再由分销商兜底承担。</li>\n<li>责任人四类义务：持有技术文档、配合监管、通知整改、作为召回联系人。</li>\n<li>授权代表与进口商法律地位不同，应按商业模式选择。</li>\n<li>履约服务商须校验标识与责任人信息，缺失时可拦截入仓——用&quot;身份缺陷 vs 表达缺陷&quot;区分拦截强度。</li>\n<li>GB 与 NI 是两个规则域，不可合并处理。</li>\n<li>责任人信息的缺失会导致商品无法证明召回触达路径，见 <a href=\"recall-execution/affected-batch-buyer-reach\">批次/序列号定位与买家反查</a>。</li>\n<li>责任人信息如何在标签与线上报价中呈现，见 <a href=\"technical-doc-traceability-label\">技术文档、可追溯标签与合规标识</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>参考来源：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Product_Safety_Regulation\">General Product Safety Regulation — Wikipedia</a>（欧盟责任人、进口商/分销商兜底、线上市场向 Safety Gate 登记）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/business/product-rules-compliance/product-safety-and-liability/selling-products-safely/index_en.htm\">Selling products safely in the EU — Your Europe</a>（制造商、分销商、授权代表均可通过 Safety Business Gateway 报告）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Product_Safety_Regulations_2005\">General Product Safety Regulations 2005 — Wikipedia</a>（英国 reg 5/7/8/9 生产者与分销商义务）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"欧盟责任人/UKRP/履约服务商义务","id":"欧盟责任人-ukrp-履约服务商义务"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么需要一个境内主体","id":"核心概念-为什么需要一个境内主体"},{"level":2,"text":"责任人承担的具体义务","id":"责任人承担的具体义务"},{"level":3,"text":"授权代表与进口商的区别","id":"授权代表与进口商的区别"},{"level":3,"text":"履约服务商被拉进责任链","id":"履约服务商被拉进责任链"},{"level":3,"text":"英国侧的对应安排","id":"英国侧的对应安排"},{"level":2,"text":"责任人信息的落库与校验","id":"责任人信息的落库与校验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GPSR 一般安全要求与适用范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/product-safety-baseline/gpsr-general-safety-requirement"},"next":{"title":"技术文档、可追溯标签与合规标识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/product-safety-baseline/technical-doc-traceability-label"}}